{"id":"irgendwann","lemma":"irgendwann","pos":"adv","rank":684,"glosses":["sometime, somewhen, anytime","at some point, someday"],"ipa":"/ˈɪʁɡəntˈvan/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/De-irgendwann.ogg/De-irgendwann.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du irgendwann einen Mann geliebt?","en":"Have you ever loved a man?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"loved"}]},{"text":"Irgendwann solltest du es mal versuchen.","en":"Someday you should give it a try.","words":[null,{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"just / once"},{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Ruf mich irgendwann mal an!","en":"Give me a call sometime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567022","words":[{"g":"to call out","l":"rufen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"just / once"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Irgendwann will ich einmal dorthin.","en":"I want to go there one day.","words":[null,{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"once, one time"},{"g":"there , thither"}]},{"text":"Tu’s bitte irgendwann heute!","en":"Please do that sometime today.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"S"},{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"today"}]}]}